104
00:06:48,525 --> 00:06:53,560
We don't want an incident agent to see
that, okay, this feature flag was enabled,

105
00:06:53,972 --> 00:06:58,451
which caused this outage, and it just
goes and auto rolls, rolls it back.

106
00:06:59,285 --> 00:06:59,512
Nope.

107
00:06:59,767 --> 00:07:01,049
We still need a human in the loop.

108
00:07:01,857 --> 00:07:07,879
So a flag enters first as evidence and
only later behind a separate boundary

109
00:07:08,454 --> 00:07:14,210
